## What we collect

When you send a form on this website, we receive what you enter in it, such as your name, email address, telephone number and the details of your coins. The forms are processed by our website host, Netlify.

## How we use it

Only to reply to you and to handle your submission. We do not sell your information, and we do not share it except as needed to deliver your coins.

## Certificate lookups

When you verify a certificate, the number you type is checked against our certificate registry. Your IP address is used briefly to prevent abuse of the lookup, and is not stored with your search.

## Cookies

This website does not use advertising or tracking cookies.

## Questions

For any question about your information, [contact us](/contact).
